{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-a",
      "title": "a；casa；mapa",
      "script": "a. casa. mapa.",
      "mouth": "口自然张开，舌位偏低，不在末尾添滑音。",
      "note": "casa读ca-sa，两处a保持清楚；不是字母名称串读。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-a.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-e",
      "title": "e；mesa；peso",
      "script": "e. mesa. peso.",
      "mouth": "舌位在口腔前部，嘴唇不圆；保持单一元音，不读成英语字母A的滑音。",
      "note": "mesa的e与peso的e同属本课五元音练习；不要求模仿中文“诶”的完整滑动。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-e.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-i",
      "title": "i；vino；piso",
      "script": "i. vino. piso.",
      "mouth": "舌位高且靠前，嘴唇不圆；声音短而清楚，不额外加一个辅音。",
      "note": "piso与peso对比i和e；先听区别，再慢慢跟读。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-i.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-o",
      "title": "o；lobo；copa",
      "script": "o. lobo. copa.",
      "mouth": "嘴唇适度圆，舌位偏后；不要从o一路滑成u。",
      "note": "copa与capa只换一个元音；对照听后再说。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-o.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-u",
      "title": "u；luna；puro",
      "script": "u. luna. puro.",
      "mouth": "嘴唇圆，舌位高且偏后；与o保持可听出的区别。",
      "note": "puro与poro练u/o；不要因为英语拼写习惯而省掉元音。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-u.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-r-rr",
      "title": "pero / perro；caro / carro",
      "script": "pero. perro. caro. carro.",
      "mouth": "词中单r常为一次短促舌尖接触；rr常为颤音。先辨听，不必用力挤喉咙。",
      "note": "pero（但是）/perro（狗）区别能改变意思；词首r通常也用强音，不能只数r字母。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-r-rr.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-n-enye",
      "title": "cana / caña；año",
      "script": "cana. caña. año.",
      "mouth": "ñ是独立字母。舌面前部靠近硬腭发鼻音；不能把它写成普通n。",
      "note": "cana（白发）/caña（芦苇；也有一杯啤酒等义）用于辨音，词义依场景选。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-n-enye.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-c-qu-z",
      "title": "casa；queso；cena",
      "script": "casa. queso. cena.",
      "mouth": "c在a/o/u前通常是/k/；qu在e/i前通常保留/k/且u不发音。c在e/i前及z的读法有地区差异。",
      "note": "本合成音采用西班牙es声音；拉美及部分西班牙地区把相关字母读/s/也是规范变体。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-c-qu-z.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-g-gu-gue",
      "title": "gato；guitarra；pingüino",
      "script": "gato. guitarra. pingüino.",
      "mouth": "g在a/o/u前与在e/i前要分开；gue/gui里的u通常不发音，güe/güi里的ü提示u也发音。",
      "note": "guitarra与pingüino不能都把u省去；先看有没有两点。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-g-gu-gue.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "quality-sound-stress",
      "title": "papa / papá；hablo / habló",
      "script": "papa. papá. hablo. habló.",
      "mouth": "先把单词分音节，再听哪一节突出。重读不等于每次都写符号。",
      "note": "papa重读第一节，papá重读最后一节；这里是声音和拼写训练，不要求先学过去时。",
      "audio": "assets/audio/quality-sound-stress.mp3"
    }
  ],
